Package: LVEXdetector
Type: Package
Title: LVE-X Model Fitting and Prediction for Bisulfite Sequencing Counts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Qicheng", "Zhao", email = "qicheng.zhao@mail.mcgill.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to fit and predict LVE-X models for bisulfite sequencing
    methylation count data (methylated and unmethylated reads). The package supports
    beta-binomial likelihood for female samples, binomial likelihood for male samples,
    and offers delta-method or parametric bootstrap confidence intervals for nu (Xa) and
    pi (Xi) under logit links.
